      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/119800883/\n1\n\n Age: 38 Years, Occ: Coolie,\n R/O: Kitali, Tq: Badami,\n Dist: Bagalkot- 587201.\n ...Respondents\n (By Sri. Anil Kale, Advocate For R1)\n -2-\n Crl.P No. 103660 of 2022\n This Criminal Petition Is Filed U/S 482 Of Cr.P.C.,\nSeeking To Quash The Entire Proceedings In Spl Case\nNo. 121/2018 On The File Of The Court Of Prl. District\nAnd Sessions Judge, Bagalkote For The Offence\nPunishable Under Section 8 And 10 Of Prevention Of\nCorruption Act, 1988 And Section 170, And 420 Of Ipc.,\nOrder Sheet Is Marked At Annexure-A Insofar As\nPetitioner/Accused Is Concerned.\n This Petition, Coming On For Orders, This Day,\nThe Court Made The Following:\n Order",
